{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .mcp.json to activate. Project-scoped MCP servers are the main thing a",
    "local session has that a cloud container does not: they reach outside this repo.",
    "",
    "Do NOT trust the package names below without checking. Prefer `claude mcp add`,",
    "which resolves the current package and writes a correct entry for you:",
    "",
    "  claude mcp add --scope project filesystem -- npx -y @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem ~/code",
    "  claude mcp list",
    "",
    "Worth having for MALACHII specifically:",
    "  filesystem  — read reference material outside this repo without copying it in",
    "  git         — history and blame across your other repos",
    "  playwright  — drive a real browser (the FutureDeskAI side of this repo)",
    "",
    "Servers here are prompted for approval on first use. Anything you add can read",
    "what you point it at, so scope the paths deliberately."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {}
}
